    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεροπλ-ίζομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπλίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vanquish by force of arms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄν τίς μιν ἀνὴρ ὑπεροπλίσσαιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.268
				</span></i>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Aristarch.
			</span></i>; others expld. it as <i>treat haughtily</i> or
				<i>scornfully</i>:—
				Act.
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			).</div>
